  "hash": 3459475454,
  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Grants the Kinetic Tremors trait:\n\nScoring multiple Direct Hits against a target within 3 seconds of each emits 3 damaging shockwaves from its location at the time of activation. Shockwaves appear 0.25 seconds after scoring enough Hits and have a 1 second delay between each pulse. Shockwaves inherit Weapon Damage Buffs.\n\nThe perk cannot be retriggered by anyone on a target until 2? seconds after the last shockwave.\n\nFor The Huckleberry, these shockwaves activate after 14 hits. Each shockwave deals <pve 215 /> <pvp [20] /> damage in a 6 meter radius and scales with its improved version of Rampage. ",
      "updatedAt": "2026-07-13T19:21:19.594Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
  "associated": [],
